lesson: 225
title: Hours, minutes and seconds
level: primary-3
stars: 1
explain: An hour has 60 minutes and a minute has 60 seconds; a day has 24 hours. Half an hour is 30 minutes and a quarter of an hour 15.
explain: To turn hours and minutes into minutes, take 60 minutes for every hour and add the extra minutes.
explain: A film of 2 hours and 15 minutes: 2 × 60 = 120, and 120 + 15 = 135 minutes.
vars: a=name h=2..4 m=5..55
answer: h * 60 + m
exercise: A film lasts {h} hours and {m} minutes. How many minutes long is the film?
exercise: {a} spends {h} hours and {m} minutes at the zoo. How many minutes is that?
exercise: A train journey takes {h} hours and {m} minutes. How many minutes does it take?
exercise: {a} is at a birthday party for {h} hours and {m} minutes. How many minutes is {a.he} there?
exercise: A walk around the lake takes {h} hours and {m} minutes. How many minutes is the walk?
exercise: movie's {h} hrs {m} mins how many mins is that
exercise: flight is {h} hours n {m} minutes, mum says thats ages. minutes?
exercise: we were at the beach {h} hours, oh plus {m} min. how many minutes
exercise: match went {h} hours {m+3}, no sorry {m} minutes. in minutes?
exercise: {a} says {h} hours {m} mins is {h*100+m} minutes lol. what is it actually
exercise: How many minutes are there in {h} hours and {m} minutes?
test: Turn {h} hours and {m} minutes into minutes.
test: The bus ride to the seaside lasts {h} hours {m} minutes. Give its length in minutes.
test: {a} sleeps on the plane for {h} hours and {m} minutes and then watches cartoons. For how many minutes does {a.he} sleep?
test: {h}h {m}m in minutes pls
test: game lasted {h} hours and {m} minutes and we won {h+2} nil! how many minutes
test: For {h} hours and {m} minutes the power was off in {a}'s street. How long was that in minutes?
exam: Determine the duration, expressed in minutes, of a cinematographic presentation lasting {h.words} hours and {m.words} minutes.
exam: It is given that a journey by rail occupies {h} hours and {m} minutes. Ascertain the duration of the said journey in minutes.
exam: State the number of minutes comprised in an interval of {h} hours and {m} minutes.
exam: An interruption of the electricity supply persisted for {h} hours and {m} minutes. Compute its duration in minutes.
exercise: The baby was "a bit unsettled" last night: he cried for {h} hours and {m} minutes. How many minutes was that?
exercise: the boss's "quick catch-up" went on {h} hours {m} mins, kill me now. how many minutes is that
test: Uncle Pete was "resting his eyes" in front of the TV for {h} hours and {m} minutes. For how many minutes did he sleep?
